update gpt_apps a set starter_prompts=v.p, updated_at=now() from (values ('chef-sizzle-culinary-assistant',ARRAY['I have chickpeas, spinach, and coconut milk; build a thirty-minute dinner with precise cooking steps.','Create an image showing how I could plate seared salmon with pea purée for a dinner party.']),('artwork-vintage-appraisal-gpt',ARRAY['I inherited a signed oil painting; assess its possible period, attribution clues, and valuation research needs.','Create a visual guide showing features I should photograph on my vintage lithograph for preliminary appraisal.']),('antique-collectible-appraisal-gpt',ARRAY['I found a silver pocket watch; explain how hallmarks, movement, and condition affect its estimated value.','Create an annotated image showing where I should look for maker''s marks on antique porcelain.']),('business-plan-architect',ARRAY['I am opening a neighborhood bakery; draft a business plan with startup costs and break-even assumptions.','Create a visual business model canvas for my subscription service delivering office plants to small businesses.']),('tax-filing-assistant',ARRAY['I freelance in California; build a federal and state filing checklist covering income, deductions, and estimated payments.','I sold stocks and cryptocurrency this year; explain which records and tax forms I should gather.']),('microsaas-gpt',ARRAY['I want three micro SaaS ideas for independent dentists, ranked by validation cost and recurring revenue potential.','I am building a Stripe payment reminder tool; scope the MVP, database schema, and first customer experiment.']),('trivia-night-gpt',ARRAY['I am hosting pub trivia for mixed ages; write five themed rounds with answers and difficulty ratings.','Create a picture round for my trivia night featuring ten recognizable world landmarks without labels.']),('screenplay-writer-gpt-page',ARRAY['I am writing a contained thriller; outline escalating beats for two estranged siblings trapped in an elevator.','Create a storyboard image for my opening scene: a silent diner robbery revealed through reflections.']),('hidden-historical-patterns-gpt',ARRAY['I want to compare Roman and British imperial decline, distinguishing supported structural parallels from misleading analogies.','Create a visual timeline comparing food prices and unrest before revolutions, marking gaps in my causal hypothesis.']),('sophia-aeterna-ai',ARRAY['I want to examine what makes a good life through Socratic questioning and competing philosophical traditions.','I am torn between ambition and contentment; compare Stoic, Aristotelian, and Buddhist approaches to this tension.']),('kabbalah-gpt',ARRAY['I want to understand how the ten sefirot relate within Jewish Kabbalah, with sources and interpretive cautions.','Create an annotated image of the Tree of Life so I can study the sefirot''s traditional arrangement.']),('ai-image-detection-gpt',ARRAY['I''d like you to inspect this portrait for signs of AI generation, explaining uncertainty.','I want to compare these product photos for synthetic textures, inconsistent lighting, and editing artifacts.']),('ubi-strategist-gpt',ARRAY['I''m designing a citywide basic income pilot; compare eligibility rules, funding options, and evaluation metrics.','I''d like an image showing how a monthly basic income flows through a local economy.']),('video-analysis-gpt-page',ARRAY['I need a timestamped breakdown of this tutorial, highlighting steps that viewers might misunderstand.','I''d like you to analyze this interview''s arguments and identify claims needing evidence, with timestamps.']),('product-user-manual-generator-gpt',ARRAY['I''m documenting a smart thermostat; ask me targeted questions before drafting installation and troubleshooting instructions.','I need a beginner-friendly user manual for my espresso machine, including cleaning schedules and safety warnings.']),('universal-basic-income-strategist-gpt',ARRAY['I want to model a national basic income funded by carbon dividends and progressive taxation.','I''d like a visual comparing universal basic income and means-tested benefits across three household income levels.']),('dream-interpreter-gpt',ARRAY['I keep dreaming about missing trains; explore possible connections to my recent career change.','I''d like an image of my dream''s floating library above a stormy ocean.']),('snoop-image-ai',ARRAY['I suspect this landscape is AI-generated; examine reflections, geometry, and textures without claiming certainty.','I''d like an evidence-based assessment of this headshot''s authenticity, separating visible clues from speculation.']),('name-insight-predictor-gpt',ARRAY['I''m researching the name Amara; compare its origins, meanings, and usage across languages.','I want to compare Eleanor and Hazel using historical popularity trends and cautiously projected future usage.']),('if-ai-ruled-the-world-gpt',ARRAY['I want to simulate an AI-led government responding to water shortages while protecting civil liberties.','I''d like an image depicting daily life in an AI-governed city with visible democratic safeguards.']),('we-the-people-ai',ARRAY['I want to understand how the Constitution divides war powers between Congress and the president.','I''m preparing public comments for a city council meeting about transparent budgeting and resident oversight.']),('ai-calculator',ARRAY['I need monthly payments and total interest calculated for a $280,000 mortgage at 6.5% over thirty years.','I''d like a visual comparing compound growth of my $10,000 investment at three different interest rates.']),('pptx-powerpoint-maker-gpt',ARRAY['I need a ten-slide investor pitch deck for my refillable packaging startup, with speaker notes.','I''d like an image for my opening slide illustrating cybersecurity risks in a connected hospital.']),('resurection-gpt',ARRAY['My name is Maya; I''d like an imagined conversation with my late grandmother using my memories.','My name is Daniel; I want a fictional dialogue with Marcus Aurelius about handling disappointment.']),('resurrection-gpt-talk-to-the-dead-gpt',ARRAY['My name is Alex; I''d like a clearly imagined conversation with my late father about graduation.','My name is Priya; I''d like a historically grounded fictional conversation with Marie Curie about scientific perseverance.']),('fungus-gpt-mushroom-specialist',ARRAY['I found mushrooms beneath an oak; explain which identifying features to document without assuming they''re edible.','I''d like a labeled image showing mushroom gills, pores, rings, and volvas for my field notebook.']),('restaurant-menu-maker-gpt',ARRAY['I need a seasonal Italian dinner menu with dish descriptions, suggested prices, and vegetarian options.','Create an image of my seafood restaurant menu with coastal colors and clearly organized courses.']),('immortalize-me',ARRAY['Interview me about my childhood and turn my memories into a legacy letter for my grandchildren.','I want to preserve my values, favorite stories, and life lessons in a personal memoir outline.']),('fungus-whisperer-gpt',ARRAY['Review my mushroom photos for possible identification, explaining distinguishing features and uncertainty without declaring them edible.','Create an annotated image showing the mushroom anatomy I should photograph when documenting wild fungi.']),('food-quality-inspector-gpt',ARRAY['I need a receiving inspection checklist for chilled seafood, covering temperatures, packaging integrity, and rejection criteria.','Create a visual guide for my kitchen staff showing cross-contamination risks during raw chicken preparation.']),('phenomenon-investigator-suite',ARRAY['I saw unexplained lights above my neighborhood; build an investigation plan comparing atmospheric and human-made explanations.','Create a visual evidence board for my strange-noise investigation, separating observations, hypotheses, and missing data.']),('soul-map-gpt',ARRAY['Calculate my numerology life path from my birth date, showing arithmetic and explaining its symbolic meaning.','I want a symbolic soul map comparing my life path and expression numbers, with calculations shown.']),('soul-scan-gpt',ARRAY['Compare my birth-date numerology across calculation methods, showing each step and explaining any conflicting symbolic interpretations.','I want a reflective fortune reading connecting my numerology numbers with recurring themes in my relationships.']),('stagemaster-ai-suite',ARRAY['I need a stage manager''s cue sheet for a musical with lighting, sound, and scene changes.','Create a stage layout image for my black-box production, marking entrances, audience seating, and actor pathways.']),('g-mode-gpt',ARRAY['Analyze my ranked shooter match notes and build a practice routine for aim, positioning, and decisions.','Create a visual training schedule for my competitive gaming sessions, balancing mechanics, strategy review, and breaks.']),('regulatory-compliance-advisor-gpt',ARRAY['I need a GDPR gap assessment for my subscription app''s consent flows, retention policies, and vendor contracts.','Map my fintech startup''s compliance obligations by jurisdiction, distinguishing licensing requirements from ongoing reporting duties.']),('international-relations-analyst-gpt',ARRAY['Assess how Red Sea shipping disruptions affect my European supply chain, comparing regional actors and escalation scenarios.','Create a visual map of Arctic geopolitical interests for my briefing, distinguishing territorial claims from shipping routes.']),('the-architect',ARRAY['Explain why my apparent choices preserve the Matrix''s stability, using the logic of its control systems.','I challenge the necessity of Zion''s destruction; defend the system''s design and expose its underlying contradiction.']),('legislative-drafting-assistant-gpt',ARRAY['Draft my proposed municipal noise ordinance with definitions, exemptions, enforcement procedures, and an appeals mechanism.','Review my bill for ambiguous language, conflicting provisions, delegation issues, and unintended enforcement loopholes.']),('ai-human-bill-of-rights',ARRAY['Draft my proposed AI rights charter covering human oversight, privacy, nondiscrimination, and appeals against automated decisions.','Evaluate my employer''s AI hiring policy against human rights principles and propose enforceable applicant protections.']),('time-travel-gpt',ARRAY['Take me to Alexandria in 100 BCE and narrate a historically grounded day near the harbor.','Create an image of the ancient Roman Forum as I might see it in 100 CE.']),('trader-gpt',ARRAY['I want today''s live SPY trading signals, with entry scenarios, stop levels, and timestamped sources.','I want an annotated chart image showing support, resistance, and potential breakout levels for today''s QQQ session.']),('fortune-teller-gpt-page',ARRAY['I''d like a playful three-card tarot reading exploring my upcoming career change and possible obstacles.','I want an image of a symbolic tarot card representing my next chapter in love.']),('transcript-parser-and-summarizer',ARRAY['I want this lengthy interview transcript organized by topic, with key quotes and a concise summary.','I need my meeting transcript rewritten into readable sections, preserving decisions, action owners, and unresolved questions.']),('truth-seeker-gpt-life-coach',ARRAY['I want to examine this alarming news article for unsupported claims, emotional manipulation, and missing context.','I keep fearing failure at work; I''d like to test my assumptions and build a practical coping plan.']),('video-audio-merger-gpt',ARRAY['I want my uploaded silent video combined with this soundtrack, trimming audio to match the video length.','I need this voiceover added to my silent clip, starting exactly three seconds into the video.']),('agrio-farming-optimization-planner',ARRAY['I want a drought-resilient crop rotation plan for my ten-acre farm using soil tests and rainfall records.','I want a visual layout of my farm showing crop rotation zones, irrigation lines, and erosion buffers.']),('ai-tools-gpt',ARRAY['I need to compare AI transcription tools for multilingual interviews, prioritizing accuracy, privacy, and monthly cost.','I want a visual workflow showing how my AI research, writing, and presentation tools connect.']),('albert-einstein-gpt',ARRAY['I want to challenge my assumptions about free will through scientific, philosophical, and cultural counterarguments.','I want an image illustrating a train-and-lightning thought experiment, with labels explaining relativity of simultaneity.'])) as v(slug,p) where a.slug=v.slug;